OL,3,GNEWSABiker killed in crash with car on
OL,4,AA70 at Lanark named
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorbike rider who died after a
OL,7,Fcrash with a car on the A70 at Lanark
OL,8,Flast week has been named by police as
OL,9,FJames Gray.
OL,11,FThe 57-year-old's black Suzuki GSX-R
OL,12,Fcollided with a silver Renault Master
OL,13,Fvan at about 15:20 on 24 August. He was
OL,14,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,16,FHis family said they were "heartbroken
OL,17,Fat the sudden loss of our dad,
OL,18,Fgrandpops, brother, partner,
OL,19,Ffather-in-law, uncle and great friend
OL,20,Fto many".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
